;
A001,0,Display Light
A001,1,Time light,stays on
A001,5,Display Light
A001,6,Entered value multiplied by 5 is the time in seconds
A001,7,how long the display is beeing lighted.
A001,8,0 is unlimited. Standard setting is 6 (30 seconds).
